    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} has a magic tome. While holding or carrying the tome, the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can use its Banishing Claw action. The tome has AC 17; HP 35; and Immunity to Necrotic, Poison, and Psychic damage. The tome regains all its Hit Points at the end of every turn, but it turns to dust if reduced to 0 Hit Points or when the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} dies. If the tome is destroyed, the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can create a new one when it finishes a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
